 fabric is used to make a 7cm big size pad. The patented 7D VITA COLLAGEN COMPLEX and salmon DNA-based PDRN provide skin glow, while hyaluronic acid and peptide provide hydration. Hexapeptide-11 provides skin elasticity, Oligopeptide-1 provides collagen synthesis, Oligopeptide-2 provides skin anti-aging, and Oligopeptide-3 provides moisturizing effect so that the complex peptide gives collagen boosting.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow to use\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1. After washing your face, in the first step of basic care, gently wipe your entire face in the direction of your skin texture, excluding the area around your eyes and mouth.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2. After use, close the cap tightly to seal the pad so that it does not dry out.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIngredients\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePurified water, butylene glycol, glycereth-26, niacinamide, glycerin, 1,2-hexanediol, diethoxyethyl succinate, hydroxyethyl urea, hydroxyacetophenone, glycereth-25 pcai isostearate, glycosyl trehalose, hydrogenated starch hydrolysate, indigo plant leaf extract, ethylhexylglycerin, xanthan gum, propanediol, adenosine, indigo plant flower extract, ivy gourd fruit extract, disodium EDTA, sodium DNA (100 ppm), hydrolyzed collagen, aloe vera flower extract, eggplant fruit extract, coptis root extract, holy basil leaf extract, corn kernel extract, coral lily extract, Curcuma longa root extract, sodium hyaluronate (5.002 ppm), hyaluronic acid (5 ppm), hydrolyzed hyaluronic acid (5 ppm), kakadu plum extract, fructan, glucose, lecithin, acetylglutamine, collagen extract, bacillus\/soybean ferment extract, caprylyl glycol, folic acid, hexapeptide-11, oligopeptide-1, oligopeptide-2, oligopeptide-3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eS